<div class="px-4 sm:px-0">
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
    <div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Custom Feeds</h1>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-700">
        <span class="font-mono">features/feeds.yml</span> — define named RSS/Atom feeds. Each is served at
        <span class="font-mono">/feed/&lt;name&gt;.xml</span> and <span class="font-mono">/feed/&lt;name&gt;.atom</span>.
      </p>
    </div>
    <%= link_to "← Settings", admin_configs_path, class: "text-sm text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-900" %>
  </div>

  <details class="mb-4 p-3 border border-gray-300 bg-gray-50 rounded text-sm">
    <summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold">Field reference</summary>
    <div class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-gray-700">
      <p>Each top-level key is a feed name — its URL slug. Under it:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-0.5">
        <li><span class="font-mono">title</span> — the feed's title (defaults to the site title)</li>
        <li><span class="font-mono">description</span> — the feed's description</li>
        <li><span class="font-mono">source</span> — <span class="font-mono">posts</span> (default), <span class="font-mono">pages</span>, <span class="font-mono">documentation</span>, or <span class="font-mono">products</span></li>
        <li><span class="font-mono">post_type</span> — limit to one type, e.g. <span class="font-mono">article</span></li>
        <li><span class="font-mono">tags</span> — include by tag; prefix a tag with <span class="font-mono">-</span> to exclude</li>
        <li><span class="font-mono">order</span> — <span class="font-mono">date</span> (default), <span class="font-mono">date-asc</span>, <span class="font-mono">title</span>, or a list of url_names</li>
        <li><span class="font-mono">limit</span> — how many items to include (default 20)</li>
        <li><span class="font-mono">audience</span> — <span class="font-mono">free</span> (default, public) or <span class="font-mono">paid</span> (members only, token-gated)</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="pt-1">A podcast needs its own feed — enable Podcasts instead.</p>
    </div>
  </details>

  <%= form_with url: admin_feeds_config_path, method: :patch do |f| %>
    <%= f.text_area :content, value: @config_content,
        class: "w-full bg-white font-mono text-sm p-2 border border-gray-300 box-border h-[420px]" %>
    <div class="mt-3 flex gap-2">
      <%= f.submit "Save Feeds",
          class: "inline-flex items-center uppercase text-sm px-2 py-1 border border-gray-800 bg-green-200 hover:bg-green-300 font-mono rounded-xs cursor-pointer" %>
      <%= link_to "Cancel", admin_configs_path,
          class: "inline-flex items-center uppercase text-sm px-2 py-1 border border-gray-800 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100 font-mono rounded-xs" %>
    </div>
  <% end %>
</div>
